-- title:
--   𝔪_R S lies in the Jacobson radical of an integral extension
-- statement:
--   Let $R$ and $S$ be commutative rings with an $R$-algebra structure on $S$, suppose $R$ is local (so it has a unique maximal ideal `IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal R`), and suppose $S$ is integral over $R$, i.e. every element of $S$ satisfies a monic polynomial with coefficients in $R$. The assertion is the inclusion of ideals of $S$
--   $$(\mathfrak{m}_R)\,S \;=\; \mathrm{Ideal.map}\,(\mathrm{algebraMap}\ R\ S)\,(\mathfrak{m}_R) \;\subseteq\; \mathrm{Jac}(0),$$
--   where $\mathfrak{m}_R$ is the maximal ideal of $R$, the left-hand side is the ideal of $S$ generated by the image of $\mathfrak{m}_R$ under the structure map $R \to S$, and the right-hand side is the Jacobson radical of the zero ideal of $S$, namely the infimum of all maximal ideals of $S$ (in Mathlib, the infimum of all ideals of $S$ containing $\bot$ that are maximal). Equivalently: every maximal ideal of $S$ contains the image of $\mathfrak{m}_R$. No finiteness, flatness or injectivity hypothesis on $R \to S$ is assumed.
--
--   This is the standard consequence of the fact that in an integral extension the maximal ideals are exactly the primes contracting to maximal ideals: over a local base, every maximal ideal of $S$ lies over $\mathfrak{m}_R$, so $\mathfrak{m}_R S$ is contained in the Jacobson radical. It serves as the input to [`IsLocalRing.isUnit_of_isUnit_mod_maximalIdeal_of_isIntegral`](thm.html#IsLocalRing.isUnit_of_isUnit_mod_maximalIdeal_of_isIntegral), which lifts detection of units from the fibre $S/\mathfrak{m}_R S$ to $S$ and thereby transfers locality of a residual group ring to the group ring over the coefficient ring.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_IsLocalRing_map_maximalIdeal_le_jacobson_bot_of_isIntegral.lean

import Mathlib.RingTheory.Ideal.GoingUp
import Mathlib.RingTheory.Jacobson.Ideal
import Mathlib.RingTheory.LocalRing.MaximalIdeal.Basic

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency.types false

theorem IsLocalRing.map_maximalIdeal_le_jacobson_bot_of_isIntegral {R S : Type*} [CommRing R] [CommRing S] [Algebra R S] [IsLocalRing R] [Algebra.IsIntegral R S] :
    (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal R).map (algebraMap R S) ≤ Ideal.jacobson (⊥ : Ideal S) := by sorry
